      "name": "dsh-kicad",
      "title": {
        "en": "KiCad",
        "zh": "KiCad 原理图助手"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "AI electronics design with KiCad: describe the circuit board you want in one sentence (/kicad-design) and the agent asks a few questions, writes the spec and draws the schematic; approve each edit, KiCad ERC after every change, interactive KiCanvas schematic/PCB viewer, /erc /drc /bom, EDA preset. Beginner friendly; MCU, USB-C power, LED and button circuits built in. Checks your KiCad installation and offers an Install KiCad button when it is missing.",
        "zh": "用 AI 做电子电路设计（KiCad）：一句话说出你想做的电路板（/kicad-design），agent 会问几个问题、写好设计规格并画出原理图；每次修改先审批、改完自动跑 KiCad ERC，内置 KiCanvas 原理图/PCB 交互查看器、/erc /drc /bom 和 EDA 预设。适合新手，内置单片机、USB-C 供电、LED 和按键等常用电路。会检查本机 KiCad 环境，缺失时提供“安装 KiCad”按钮。"
      },
